# Picking several answers and sending them together: ANSWERS=scripts/duo-multiple.json HEX=kept scripts/duo tap <ref> scripts/duo-multiple-taps
# A tap on an option checks it instead of answering, a second tap unchecks it, and the button
# under them stays dimmed until one is checked; it sends the checked ones as one answer, and the
# card folds to them joined by "; ". The one-answer question under it still answers on one tap.
launch hexvoice:///?tasks=general
wait 3
shoot multiple-rest
tap brim
wait 1
tap iikb, hex’s pick
wait 1
tap denoise
wait 1
tap denoise
wait 1
selected iikb, hex’s pick
selected brim
unselected denoise
shoot multiple-picked
reveal Answer with 2
settle
shoot multiple-ready
tap Answer with 2
wait 1
shoot multiple-answered
reveal Yes, hex’s pick
settle
tap Yes, hex’s pick
wait 1
shoot multiple-single-answered
